> 2] (1 Stimme voll zu /4 Stimme ueberhaupt nicht zu) 
>                 replace plh0308_v1 = . if plh0308_v1 <0
>                         revrs plh0308_v1 
>                         drop plh0308_v1
> 
>                 *Working Mothers Equal Emotional (1 Stimme voll zu /4 Stimme 
> ueberhaupt nicht zu)
>                 replace plh0309 = . if plh0309 <0
>                         revrs plh0309 
>                         drop plh0309
>                                 
>         * Check Cronbachs alpha >= 0.7
>         factor plh0301 plh0302_v1 revplh0303 revplh0304 plh0307 revplh0308_v1
>  revplh0309  //Factor1 eigenvalue 1.9, suggested factor 1.
>         alpha  plh0301 plh0302_v1 revplh0303 revplh0304 plh0307 revplh0308_v1
>  revplh0309, item 
> 
>         *Item 304 does not fit (also loads onto factor3 on its own, and is ve
> ry unique)
>         *Alpha currently 0.67
>         *If remove item plh0304 (Children Suffer When Father Focused On Caree
> r), new alpha 0.72
>         alpha plh0301 plh0302_v1 revplh0303 plh0307 revplh0308_v1 revplh0309,
>  item //new alpha: 0.72
>         */
. 
. 
